  m_text: 'EMITTER releases a pulse. REFLECTOR turns it 45 deg. ABSORBER stops it.

    SPLITTER
    forks it. DELAY PLATE holds it. RECEIVER needs a pulse.

    RESONATOR needs
    two. Forbidden receivers must stay silent.'
